      "image": "images/posts/on-this-day-in-space-nov-14-1969-nasas-apollo-12-astronauts-laun.jpg",
      "imageAlt": "Drawing a pinpoint on the moon costs a mission its orbit — Photo by Sweder Breet on Unsplash",
